1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,130
Man: Did you end up seeing that movie yesterday with your friend?

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:10,456
Woman: Yes, It was a good way to spend some time with her.

3
00:00:10,456 --> 00:00:13,270
It was an afternoon show and the place was practically empty.

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,050
Man: How was the movie?

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:20,190
Woman: It was okay. There were lots of unexpected twists, but It was too long.

6
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:22,100
Man: Should I see it?

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,277
Woman: I'm not sure I'd pay money to see it in the theater.

8
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:28,210
Just wait a few months and it will be out on streaming.

9
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:32,169
Man: That's usually how I watch movies these days anyway.
